sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Android device
  participant D as JmDNS LAN
  participant B as Peer
  A->>A: Start foreground service
  A->>D: Advertise Warpinator service
  D-->>A: Resolve peer service metadata
  A->>B: UDP certificate request / registration
  B-->>A: Boxed certificate
  A->>B: gRPC TLS channel
  B-->>A: Peer information and availability
  A->>B: Transfer operation RPC
